# Phase Balance Summary

| Phase | Focus | Main work packages |
|-------|--------|---------------------|
| **1** | Operational pipeline (AWS) | Contract, Ingestion, SQS, Aggregator, DynamoDB, **gRPC API**, AWS Terraform, basic observability, CI |
| **2** | Cross-cloud, analytics, **UI first slice** | Forwarder, Pub/Sub, Analytics, BigQuery, GCP Terraform, **user_interface/** (Elixir/Phoenix LiveView, Aggregator gRPC client, list + detail), CI for GCP and UI |
| **3** | Event backbone, **UI full slice**, production | Kafka/MSK (opt.), schema registry (opt.), **UI streaming + Analytics gRPC + voter activity**, Grafana, alerting, E2E tests, load/runbooks, OIDC/security |

Each phase delivers a **shippable slice**: Phase 1 = operational system on AWS; Phase 2 = multi-cloud analytics; Phase 3 = production-grade event backbone and observability. Work is spread across infra, application, observability, and quality in all three phases so that no single phase is disproportionately large or small.

